      "sectionBackground": "neutral",
      "einleitung": "<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull is-light has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-center is-style-default\" style=\"padding-top:15vh;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--content);min-height:100px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-primary-background-color has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"></span><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-2239\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/11-WineAcademy_Portrait_014498-scaled-e1714557110838.jpg\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide has-white-color has-text-color has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:280px\"></div>\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color has-text-color has-base-color wp-block-post-title wp-elements-1f73820135701125b82a0d4162906c6e\">Team</h1>\n<p class=\"has-base-color has-text-color has-link-color has-l-font-size wp-elements-0782487c1bd892cb29f50680d3392531\">gemeinsam bewegen &amp; neue Maßstäbe setzen</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-9 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover aligncenter is-style-fit-image wp-duotone-unset-4\" style=\"min-height:488px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#8d745c\"></span><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-2235\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1642\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1706px) 100vw, 1706px\" src=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/23-WineAcademy_Portrait_014703-scaled-e1714550954106.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/23-WineAcademy_Portrait_014703-scaled-e1714550954106.jpg 1706w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/23-WineAcademy_Portrait_014703-scaled-e1714550954106-300x289.jpg 300w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/23-WineAcademy_Portrait_014703-scaled-e1714550954106-1024x986.jpg 1024w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/23-WineAcademy_Portrait_014703-scaled-e1714550954106-768x739.jpg 768w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/23-WineAcademy_Portrait_014703-scaled-e1714550954106-1536x1478.jpg 1536w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/23-WineAcademy_Portrait_014703-scaled-e1714550954106-480x462.jpg 480w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/23-WineAcademy_Portrait_014703-scaled-e1714550954106-800x770.jpg 800w\" width=\"1706\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"></p>\n</div></div>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-l-font-size\">Elisabeth Neumüller</h2>\n<p class=\"has-s-font-size\" style=\"margin-top:0;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase\">founder</p>\n<p>Elisabeth Neumüller studierte Lehramt und durchlief prägende Stationen in der Gastronomie, in der sie auch ihre Begeisterung für Wein entdeckt hat. Im Oktober 2024 hat sie ihr WSET Diploma abgeschlossen. <br/>Damit bringt Elisabeth “first hand” Erfahrungen in unser Kursprogramm und die Durchführung der <a href=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/kurse/weinkurse/\" title=\"Weinkurse\">Kurse</a>. Neugier, Beharrlichkeit und Feingefühl sind nur ein paar von Elisabeths Eigenschaften, die sie auszeichnen.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-10 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light is-style-fit-image\" style=\"min-height:488px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#87715a\"></span><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-2353\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1642\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1706px) 100vw, 1706px\" src=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/X6A9214-scaled-e1714550698729.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/X6A9214-scaled-e1714550698729.jpg 1706w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/X6A9214-scaled-e1714550698729-300x289.jpg 300w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/X6A9214-scaled-e1714550698729-1024x986.jpg 1024w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/X6A9214-scaled-e1714550698729-768x739.jpg 768w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/X6A9214-scaled-e1714550698729-1536x1478.jpg 1536w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/X6A9214-scaled-e1714550698729-480x462.jpg 480w, https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/X6A9214-scaled-e1714550698729-800x770.jpg 800w\" width=\"1706\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"></p>\n</div></div>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-l-font-size\">Ina Finn</h2>\n<p class=\"has-s-font-size\" style=\"margin-top:0;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase\">founder</p>\n<p>Ina Finn verfügt über mehr als 20 Jahre Erfahrung in der Weinbranche und unterrichtet WSET und andere weinbezogene Kurse. <br/>Sie besitzt das WSET-Diploma für Weine und Spirituosen, den WSET-Abschluss Level III Sake und sie hat die WSET-Ausbilderprogramme für WSET Sake Level I und WSET <a href=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/buchung/wset-level-1-weine/\" title=\"WSET Level I Weine\">Level I</a>,<a href=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/buchung/wset-level-ii-weine/\" title=\"WSET Level II Weine\"> II</a>, <a href=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/buchung/wset-level-iii-wines/\" title=\"WSET Level III Weine\">III</a> Weine. Sie ist außerdem <a href=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/produkt-kategorie/kurse/weinkurse/bourgogne/\" title=\"Bourgogne\">Bourgogne</a> Wine Ambassador.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:98px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill has-primary-mixed-cut-transparent-gradient-background has-background\" style=\"border-radius:0rem;grid-template-columns:55% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/Rebe-vor-Bluete_quadrat-1024x1024.png);background-position:71% 16%\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1889 size-full\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/wp-content/uploads/Rebe-vor-Bluete_quadrat-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-12 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--xxl);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--xxl)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Gemeinsam wachsen</h2>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-m-font-size\">2024 ist das Gründungsjahr der Wine Academy Hamburg. Unsere <a href=\"https://www.wineacademy.de/\" title=\"Weinschule\">Weinschule</a> legt den Ausbildungs- und Weiterbildungsfokus auf Wein. Aber auch Getränkethemen aus aller Welt sowie Service- &amp; Dienstleistungsformaten wollen wir  auf eine zeitgemäße und fortschrittliche Plattform bringen.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-2 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-m-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#0\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Unsere Kurse →</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<p></p>",
